this is an example of an iboxreplica that will create a PVC for the remote replica using iscsi protocol and ASYNC replication and for a CG.  Each member of
the CG will get a remote PVC created with a unique pvc name based
on the iboxreplica remote_pvc_name appended with the CG member name. 

To test this you would:

 * make setup
 * verify that the iboxreplica, pvc, pv was created on the kube cluster
 * manually remove the iboxreplica, that should remove the replication
 * manually look up a remote PVC that was created, get its name, it will
   be something like "iscsi-pvc-anno-box-ht23"
 * modify pod.yaml to create the pod using the remote PVC name from above
 * make setup-pod
 * verify that the pod starts and mounts the remote pvc that was created
